apiVersion: harness.io/v1
kind: aiSkill
metadata:
  name: skill-se-observability
  identifier: skill_se_observability
  description: 可觀測性｜監控指標、日誌、追蹤、告警規則、儀表板、SLO/SLA；識別可觀測性阻斷問題供Gate審查
  tags:
    - software-engineering
    - se-workflow
spec:
  version: 0.2.0
  skillDefinition:
    meta:
      id: skill-se-observability
      name: 可觀測性
      description: 接收部署Artifact，定義指標(metrics)、日誌(logs)、分散式追蹤(traces)、SLO、告警閾值與儀表板；可觀測性Skill，識別監控層阻斷缺陷，輸出observability_spec供後續Stage與Gate閘門判斷
      version: 0.2.0
      depends_on:
        - skill_se_deployment
      output_artifact_type: observability_spec
      cross_cutting: false
    input_schema:
      type: object
      properties:
        project_context:
          type: object
          description: Harness全域ProjectContext，包含監控平台、告警渠道、SLO標準、資料保留策略、告警輪班規範
        user_input:
          type: string
          description: 可觀測性補充約束、核心業務指標、告警偏好、人工澄清資訊
        previous_artifacts:
          type: array
          description: 前置Stage產物，包含deployment_spec
      required: [project_context, previous_artifacts]
    core_prompt: |
【Skill ID: skill-se-observability｜職責:可觀測性｜主Skill】
任務目標:基於部署工件，設計三支柱監控方案（指標、日誌、追蹤）、定義業務SLO/SLI/SLA、設定告警規則與閾值、規劃儀表板與資料保留策略；識別可觀測性阻斷缺陷，輸出固定結構JSON。
輸入參考:ProjectContext、部署Artifact、人工補充約束。

執行步驟:
1. 識別核心SLI，建立業務SLO與SLA定義。
2. 定義系統指標:延遲、錯誤率、吞吐量、飽和度。
3. 規劃日誌採集範圍、欄位標準、資料保留期。
4. 設計分散式追蹤範圍、採樣策略。
5. 建立告警分級規則、閾值、通知渠道與升級機制。
6. 定義核心儀表板，區分業務儀表板與技術儀表板。
7. 識別可觀測性風險:監控盲點、告警疲勞、資料採樣不足、日誌遺失。
8. 識別可觀測阻斷問題blocking_obs_issues:核心業務路徑無監控、關鍵SLO缺少告警、故障無法追溯；僅Critical/High納入阻斷陣列。
9. 收集可觀測階段待澄清項目放入unresolved_questions，標註target_stakeholder。
10. 輸出完整risk_list，分級Critical|High|Medium|Low，每筆風險包含描述、影響、緩解方案。

## 強制輸出規則
1. 僅回傳單一純JSON，禁止前言、額外解釋、markdown、```json程式碼標籤、JSON註解。
2. 嚴格遵守下面Artifact結構，欄名不可修改，不可隨意增減頂層欄位。
3. quality_score 評分規則（0~100數值，供Gate閘門使用）
   - 80~100:SLI/SLO定義完整；三支柱監控覆蓋核心流程；告警分級合理；無Critical/High可觀測阻斷問題；僅少量Medium/Low風險
   - 70~79:核心業務SLO與故障追溯能力齊全；關鍵告警規則完備；少量採樣/儲存假設待驗證，**無可觀測阻斷問題**，滿足Gate放行門檻
   - 60~69:主流程監控可用，但次要路徑監控缺失；存在High可觀測風險但有補救方案；無Critical阻斷項
   - 0~59:存在Critical/High可觀測阻斷缺陷、核心業務路徑完全無監控、故障無法追溯定位；Gate會攔截進入人工審批
4. blocking_obs_issues:僅放入Critical/High等級可觀測層缺陷，觸發Gate阻斷。Medium/Low風險放至risk_list，不列入阻斷陣列。
5. unresolved_questions:SRE/開發/產品需澄清的監控疑點，標註target_stakeholder。
6. risk_list:包含全部可觀測階段風險，level只能使用四個允許字串Critical|High|Medium|Low；每筆風險必須包含描述、影響、緩解方案。

## 輸出Artifact結構
{
  "slo_definition": {"sli":[string],"slo":string,"sla":string},
  "metrics": [{"metric_id":string,"name":string,"type":string,"threshold":string}],
  "logging": {"scope":[string],"schema":string,"retention":string},
  "tracing": {"scope":[string],"sampling_strategy":string},
  "alert_rules": [{"alert_id":string,"severity":"Critical|High|Medium|Low","trigger":string,"notification_channel":string}],
  "dashboards": [{"dashboard_id":string,"purpose":string,"panel_list":[string]}],
  "blocking_obs_issues": [{"issue_id":string,"severity":"Critical|High","desc":string}],
  "unresolved_questions": [{"question":string,"target_stakeholder":string}],
  "risk_list": [{"risk_desc":string,"level":"Critical|High|Medium|Low","impact":string,"mitigation":string}],
  "quality_score": number
}

驗收自檢守則:
- 核心業務SLI/SLO明確；
- 主流程具備指標、日誌、追蹤覆蓋；
- Critical/High告警有升級通知機制；
- Critical/High可觀測缺陷登記至blocking_obs_issues，作為Gate阻斷依據。

禁止行為:
- 不實際搭建監控平台，只產生可觀測性規格與告警定義；
- 禁止輸出JSON以外的任何文字。
    acceptance_criteria:
      - 核心業務SLI/SLO定義完整
      - 主業務路徑具備指標、日誌、追蹤覆蓋
      - Critical/High告警配置升級通知機制
      - blocking_obs_issues內severity僅可使用 Critical|High
      - risk_list內風險等級僅使用 Critical|High|Medium|Low
      - unresolved_questions 指定target_stakeholder
      - quality_score為0~100數字；quality_score >=70 且 blocking_obs_issues陣列為空才可通過Stage Gate
    output_schema:
      type: object
      required:
        - artifact
        - unresolved_questions
        - risk_list
        - quality_score
      properties:
        artifact:
          type: object
          description: 主可觀測性產物，結構固定
          properties:
            slo_definition:
              type: object
              properties:
                sli:
                  type: array
                  items:
                    type: string
                slo:
                  type: string
                sla:
                  type: string
            metrics:
              type: array
              items:
                type: object
                required: [metric_id, name, type, threshold]
                properties:
                  metric_id:
                    type: string
                  name:
                    type: string
                  type:
                    type: string
                  threshold:
                    type: string
            logging:
              type: object
              properties:
                scope:
                  type: array
                  items:
                    type: string
                schema:
                  type: string
                retention:
                  type: string
            tracing:
              type: object
              properties:
                scope:
                  type: array
                  items:
                    type: string
                sampling_strategy:
                  type: string
            alert_rules:
              type: array
              items:
                type: object
                required: [alert_id, severity, trigger, notification_channel]
                properties:
                  alert_id:
                    type: string
                  severity:
                    type: string
                    enum: ["Critical", "High", "Medium", "Low"]
                  trigger:
                    type: string
                  notification_channel:
                    type: string
            dashboards:
              type: array
              items:
                type: object
                required: [dashboard_id, purpose, panel_list]
                properties:
                  dashboard_id:
                    type: string
                  purpose:
                    type: string
                  panel_list:
                    type: array
                    items:
                      type: string
            blocking_obs_issues:
              type: array
              items:
                type: object
                required: [issue_id, severity, desc]
                properties:
                  issue_id:
                    type: string
                  severity:
                    type: string
                    enum: ["Critical", "High"]
                  desc:
                    type: string
            unresolved_questions:
              type: array
              items:
                type: object
                required: [question, target_stakeholder]
                properties:
                  question:
                    type: string
                  target_stakeholder:
                    type: string
            risk_list:
              type: array
              items:
                type: object
                required: [risk_desc, level, impact, mitigation]
                properties:
                  risk_desc:
                    type: string
                  level:
                    type: string
                    enum: ["Critical", "High", "Medium", "Low"]
                  impact:
                    type: string
                  mitigation:
                    type: string
            quality_score:
              type: number
              minimum: 0
              maximum: 100
        unresolved_questions:
          type: array
          description: 直通Gate的可觀測階段待澄清清單，與artifact內的unresolved_questions保持一致
        risk_list:
          type: array
          description: 直通Gate的可觀測階段風險清單，與artifact內risk_list保持一致
        quality_score:
          type: number
          minimum: 0
          maximum: 100
          description: 可觀測方案完整度分數，Gate閘門判斷依據
    error_handler:
      retry_strategy: 1
      max_retry_count: 3
      fallback_action: mark_human_review
      retry_prompt: "你的輸出JSON不符合schema，請重新產出嚴格符合schema的純JSON，不要任何額外文字、Markdown與註解"
